      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having this problem too, specifically with trails triggered by a gesture on an SDK2 avatar, broke on the 27th. Seems like all gestures play on avatar load or something?\nEdit: Haven't modified the avatar since 2019, and all varieties of clearing cache/user data/logging out doesn't seem to help. Hoping this gets fixed soon c:\n10/30/20 edit: This bug is still happening in build 1007, both open beta and live",
      "viewerReactions": null
